WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Where you place an object changes how an image reads.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Make the first photograph with your object in the centre. Notice the space on either side.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Change the frame around the same object. Notice the space that opens beside it.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.000
The first feels steady. The second gives space a larger role. Choose the placement deliberately.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Make two photographs of the same object: one in the centre, one toward an edge. Keep the light and compare.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.000
What changed? Write a practice note, save it, then explicitly complete the exercise in the app.

